OL,3,ASir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,4,A'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death at 86
OL,6,
OL,7,F"He wore his heart on his sleeve, which
OL,8,Fmade him a man to rely on, to admire
OL,9,Fand, in my case, love," Sir Ian, Sir
OL,10,FPatrick's X-Men co-star, said.
OL,12,FFamous for his role as Captain Jean-Luc
OL,13,FPicard in Star Trek, Sir Patrick was a
OL,14,Fversatile actor who won multiple
OL,15,Fawards, balancing Hollywood roles and a
OL,16,Fcareer in classical theatre.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
