OL,3,ASir Patrick Stewart: Actor who moved
OL,4,Aeffortlessly between Star Trek and
OL,5,AShakespeare
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the world's most versatile
OL,8,Factors, he mastered both comedy and
OL,9,Ftragedy, science-fiction and historical
OL,10,Fdrama - despite the entertainment
OL,11,Findustry's traditional dislike of bald
OL,12,Fheads.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
